Hello there....

You have probably allready noticed different bugs, and tings that you
didn't like. This demo was made in a hurry for the Gathering 1995 demo-party.
And is therefor lacking one demo-part actually, that's the reason for the
light-glowed sphere. Another irritating thing, was the size of it. The
reason for this is for the first I'm using 2 different protected mode
interfaces(which I will fix..). DOS4GW sucks 246Kb of the space, the
other one is using 7Kb. When I was about to link and pack the demo, I
found out that my packer/depacker wasn't excactly working that good.
And after some days of coding, I figured out that, it was more or less
impossible to hunt down the bug in 2 days. So all graphics/animations/music
is RAW. It was also supposed to be only one file, but as you can see, it
is eight. The reason for this is, that the stupid PM GUS player I'm using
is using conventional memory, I will also fix this as soon as possible.

Anyway, I hoped you enjoyed it.

